{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07、S11略微涉及希望被对方想起、被对方需要，但这些仍从属于对眼前亲密的珍惜，没有取代亲密本身成为主线。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S07、S09把核心逐渐转向对方是否需要自己的陪伴、是否愿意继续让自己陪伴，缩窄了亲密幸福的含义。\",\n    \"S11把留不住亲密的痛楚改成对方未来是否愿意继续陪伴自己的不确定，偏向关系意愿是否对等。\",\n    \"S13把痛楚进一步转向渴望得到不变的承诺及对承诺能否兑现的怀疑，使主线偏向寻求关系保障，而非幸福与无法留住幸福本身难以分开。\",\n    \"S14增加了对自己是否后悔这样喜欢过的自我确认，略微转向对自身情感选择的评价。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X始终让亲密带来的幸福与对它终将消逝的痛楚相互缠绕：越享受、越坦露、越珍惜，就越意识到无法保证它一直存在。Y虽然保留了大部分情节和情绪，但多次把焦点收窄到对方是否需要自己、是否愿意继续接受自己的陪伴，以及能否给出不变的承诺，因而讲成了与Center相近但更具体的另一件事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c27fd67b-d65a-4029-bb86-01be21ba1748", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T102205718501Z", "elapsed_seconds": 15.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:22:21.070729+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b6c434d9b8677266d87ec302cf13b2f7f06b54f7ca3a8833403367df606b2600", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T102205718501Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e4858f4fa12939f226977f4cfdb29a4fdaab8bf42dc1b3b0d30a582161383d0a"}}}
